    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d477">

                <pb facs="0624" n="522" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg522"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2395: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-09-04T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                                1919, 3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your September 1, 4 p.m.</p>
                <p>In view of understanding between the Department and Japanese Embassy covered by
                    Department’s November 16, 6 p.m., and December 5, 8 p.m.,<anchor n="16"
                        xml:id="d477-f1"/> and pending proposals for consortium which is intended to
                    include specifically provincial loans the Department believes that it would be
                    impolitic to approve of proposed Hupeh provincial loan.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
